# Macro Alt-Data Nowcast Skill

When the user asks for 另类数据, 高频行业景气, 电商/招聘/地产/汽车/家电高频数据, 行业 nowcast, 特色数据监控, 景气度前瞻, or an alternative-data industry nowcasting report, use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/macro-altdata-nowcast
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/macro-altdata-nowcast/SKILL.md`.
2. For the category→method map, the mandatory code-resolution step, YoY/MoM & stat_type rules, the prosperity scoring convention, report format, empty-data handling, or QA, also read `.cursor/skills/macro-altdata-nowcast/references/altdata-playbook.md`.
3. Validate generated reports with `.cursor/skills/macro-altdata-nowcast/scripts/validate_report.py`.
4. Use the local `pandadata-api` skill for the exact `get_macro_detail` and `get_macro_*` contracts before any real API call.
5. **First** call `get_macro_detail(category=<X>)` to resolve opaque indicator codes (EC/MD/EH/AD/HA/OF/RB/RE/ED/EP) to name/unit/frequency/stat_type/source; never report a raw code or bare `data_value`.
6. Respect `stat_type` (do not double-difference already-YoY series); mark frequency and window; flag the provisional tail.
7. Label the data as an alternative/timely **sample** that nowcasts (≠ official statistic), state the prosperity-scoring convention, frame any lead/lag vs official as observation (hand official series to `macro-monitor`), and never invent indicator meanings, values, credentials, or investment advice.
